(7075575, 1076236, 75618, '<td valign="top">This image feels very alive. I love how the birds'' motions are complemented by the kids. Processing is just right, wonderful tones and the overlay is very seamlessly blended. The only thing I don''t like is the distracting stark white border. I understand you were probably simulating a polaroid but I think it would have been much better if it was off-white with a very slight yellow or brown tint. 9</td>', 'This image feels very alive. I love how the birds'' motions are complemented by the kids. Processing is just right, wonderful tones and the overlay is very seamlessly blended. The only thing I don''t like is the distracting stark white border. I understand you were probably simulating a polaroid but I think it would have been much better if it was off-white with a very slight yellow or brown tint. 9', '2013-07-22 13:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
