(7077321, 1076433, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the mood here with just the open window and the sailboat weathervane. It projects the feel of a summer breeze while sailing the boat out on the lake without ever leaving the room. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the mood here with just the open window and the sailboat weathervane. It projects the feel of a summer breeze while sailing the boat out on the lake without ever leaving the room. Nicely captured.', '2013-07-26 09:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077324, 1076345, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Captures the mood and memories of childhood happiness of the past - what could be better than riding the carousel?;-) Love the happy smile on the girl rider. The texture is subtle giving the feel of age so that it projects the feel of a time worn memory. Not sure about the border - it does give the feel of an old poloriod but I think it could stand alone without it and still have the strong retro feel.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Captures the mood and memories of childhood happiness of the past - what could be better than riding the carousel?;-) Love the happy smile on the girl rider. The texture is subtle giving the feel of age so that it projects the feel of a time worn memory. Not sure about the border - it does give the feel of an old poloriod but I think it could stand alone without it and still have the strong retro feel.', '2013-07-26 09:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
