(7077644, 1076236, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment and bump up.<br/> <br/>There is something very ''down the shore'' about this capture. The border works on this one - making it feel like a cross between an old photograph in a scrapbook and a polaroid. The image grain, the shift in colors due to age, and the water stains project the idea that this as a well loved captured memory of a day at the beach. Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment and bump up. There is something very ''down the shore'' about this capture. The border works on this one - making it feel like a cross between an old photograph in a scrapbook and a polaroid. The image grain, the shift in colors due to age, and the water stains project the idea that this as a well loved captured memory of a day at the beach. Nicely done.', '2013-07-26 23:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077645, 1076346, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very nice candid portrait of a girl in her backyard garden. The faded hues speak of a time in the past. The overlay adds the texture of time - a well worn photograph.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very nice candid portrait of a girl in her backyard garden. The faded hues speak of a time in the past. The overlay adds the texture of time - a well worn photograph.', '2013-07-26 23:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077648, 1076351, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Spectacular work with this still life! Love the faded warm hues which nourishes the mood that these faded &amp; dried roses are a sentimental keepsake. The texture overlay adds to the warmth of the photo but also gives a sense of touch especially with the dried roses. We can ''feel'' the age of the dried petals.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Spectacular work with this still life! Love the faded warm hues which nourishes the mood that these faded & dried roses are a sentimental keepsake. The texture overlay adds to the warmth of the photo but also gives a sense of touch especially with the dried roses. We can ''feel'' the age of the dried petals.', '2013-07-27 00:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077650, 1076406, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Very nice photo of this day at the beach for father and son. Love the colors and capture. It is a strong photograph in of itself but for me the textural overlay is overbearing. Rather than support/project the mood of a time worn memory the texture overpowers the image with being in the forefront. I think it is especially overpowering with the ''pebble/ scattered stone'' texture on the bottom half where the sand is. The ''cobblestone'' bumpy feel of the stones is in direct conflict with the smoothness of the sand - if anything would complement the textural feel of sand it would be the ''grittiness'' of noise or the possibly the texture you see in the sky (but only less). I think if you pulled back on the opacity of the texture to make it more subtle it would compliment the photo more rather than overpower it.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Very nice photo of this day at the beach for father and son. Love the colors and capture. It is a strong photograph in of itself but for me the textural overlay is overbearing. Rather than support/project the mood of a time worn memory the texture overpowers the image with being in the forefront. I think it is especially overpowering with the ''pebble/ scattered stone'' texture on the bottom half where the sand is. The ''cobblestone'' bumpy feel of the stones is in direct conflict with the smoothness of the sand - if anything would complement the textural feel of sand it would be the ''grittiness'' of noise or the possibly the texture you see in the sky (but only less). I think if you pulled back on the opacity of the texture to make it more subtle it would compliment the photo more rather than overpower it.', '2013-07-27 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077659, 1076459, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Wonderful details on the butterfly and love the angle where you see this beautiful insect framed by the leaf and the pink flower in the backdrop. I like the colors too - a little faded to give a sense of age. The texture overlay is something I''m not sure really works. While it gives some good texture feel to the leaf it makes the backdrop rather busy and in a way overpowering. I wonder what this would look like if the opacity was lowered to be more subtle or if another texture would have given a better balance.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Wonderful details on the butterfly and love the angle where you see this beautiful insect framed by the leaf and the pink flower in the backdrop. I like the colors too - a little faded to give a sense of age. The texture overlay is something I''m not sure really works. While it gives some good texture feel to the leaf it makes the backdrop rather busy and in a way overpowering. I wonder what this would look like if the opacity was lowered to be more subtle or if another texture would have given a better balance.', '2013-07-27 00:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
