(7077839, 1076251, 65234, '<td valign="top">We''ll start with the model, who has what I see as a 50''s sort of pose.  And the mostly muted colors feel retro.  But ... the Aquabot has more color than anything else in the scene.   Not really sure what I think of that, since it''s neither retro nor the most interesting thing in the image.  Also (and I know this may be picky to notice) the hose looks pretty well in focus as does the fence to its left, but the fence on the right is totally blurred out and the building isn''t sharp where I expect it to be to match the hose.  My eye keeps trying to make sense of the DOF and not being able to.  Maybe a Lensbaby kind of thing but I don''t remember noticing that disparity before.</td>', 'We''ll start with the model, who has what I see as a 50''s sort of pose.  And the mostly muted colors feel retro.  But ... the Aquabot has more color than anything else in the scene.   Not really sure what I think of that, since it''s neither retro nor the most interesting thing in the image.  Also (and I know this may be picky to notice) the hose looks pretty well in focus as does the fence to its left, but the fence on the right is totally blurred out and the building isn''t sharp where I expect it to be to match the hose.  My eye keeps trying to make sense of the DOF and not being able to.  Maybe a Lensbaby kind of thing but I don''t remember noticing that disparity before.', '2013-07-27 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077840, 1076455, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light/glow on the grapes.  Processing strays toward cartoonish, but not completely consistently, since the grapes closer to the foreground don''t have that outlined look.</td>', 'Nice light/glow on the grapes.  Processing strays toward cartoonish, but not completely consistently, since the grapes closer to the foreground don''t have that outlined look.', '2013-07-27 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
