(7077867, 1076411, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think I''m seeing a flower with a really heavy overlay.  Kind of "trash the flower" look, which is ... different, but not bad.</td>', 'I think I''m seeing a flower with a really heavy overlay.  Kind of "trash the flower" look, which is ... different, but not bad.', '2013-07-27 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7077868, 1076346, 65234, '<td valign="top">Her expression reminds me very much of pictures from the 1960s/70s.  I''m sure the processing is contributing to the feeling.  Really like that expression ... she''s not giving away what she''s thinking.</td>', 'Her expression reminds me very much of pictures from the 1960s/70s.  I''m sure the processing is contributing to the feeling.  Really like that expression ... she''s not giving away what she''s thinking.', '2013-07-27 18:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
