(7077870, 1076353, 65234, '<td valign="top">The cobweb on the hat!  Awesome.  And that insouciant pose in the photo.  Great find!  Like a place that''s just been rediscovered after years and years.  I want to explore.</td>', 'The cobweb on the hat!  Awesome.  And that insouciant pose in the photo.  Great find!  Like a place that''s just been rediscovered after years and years.  I want to explore.', '2013-07-27 18:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
